{"question_text": {"Orthodontics 1": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) (গাইড বই দেখে প্রথমেই কোন উত্তর ভুল ভাবার আগে একবার যথাযথ সুত্র থেকে দেখে নিবেন। আমরা প্রতি পরীক্ষার পরদিন ভুল থাকলে ঠিক করে দেই, তারপরও কোন ভুল আছে মনে হলে আমাদেরকে গ্রুপে বা পেজে জানাবেন। ধন্যবাদ।) The word ‘ortho’ is a-", "option1": "ক) Latin word", "option2": "খ) Greek word", "option3": "গ) English word", "option4": "ঘ) Roman word", "answer": "2", "exp": ""}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) Following who determines the aims and objectives of Orthodontic treatment", "option1": "ক) Jasson", "option2": "খ) Robinson", "option3": "গ) Jackson", "option4": "ঘ) Angles", "answer": "3", "exp": ""}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) An orthodontist brings about changes in-", "option1": "ক) 2 planes", "option2": "খ) 5 planes", "option3": "গ) 4 planes", "option4": "ঘ) 3 planes", "answer": "4", "exp": ""}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) Atrophy of thymus gland is an example of", "option1": "ক) Growth", "option2": "খ) Development", "option3": "গ) Differentiation", "option4": "ঘ) None of above", "answer": "1", "exp": ""}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) In comparison between  american blacks and white , calcification and eruption of teeth in black occurs almost", "option1": "ক) 1 year later", "option2": "খ) 1 year earlier", "option3": "গ) 2 years earlier", "option4": "ঘ) 6 month earlier", "answer": "2", "exp": ""}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) The range of mixed dentition growth spurt in boys-", "option1": "ক) 11-13 years", "option2": "খ) 7-9 years", "option3": "গ) 12-14 years", "option4": "ঘ) 8-11 years", "answer": "4", "exp": ""}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) Growth modification by means of functional and orthodontic appliances elicit better response-", "option1": "ক) Before growth spurt", "option2": "খ) After growth spurt", "option3": "গ) During growth spurt", "option4": "ঘ) During infantile period", "answer": "3", "exp": ""}, {"id": "8", "question": "৮) Which is not a method of gathering growth data", "option1": "ক) Longitudina